            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>NEXUS System Notes</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);">
            All events are managed through the NEXUS Festival Platform v3.2.1. Venue assignments 
            are subject to change based on real-time capacity monitoring. For live updates, check 
            the NEXUS Festival Hub or contact a volunteer with a blue lanyard.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 0.5rem;">
            Note: The NEXUS maintenance window at 21:00 on Day 1 is a routine scheduled operation. 
            The system will be unavailable for approximately 15 minutes. All automated services 
            — including badge validation, lighting control, and media display — will continue via 
            the AETHER continuity protocol during downtime.
        </p>
